{
  "duration": 107.5,
  "songStart": 19.0,
  "songEnd": 94.56,
  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": 2,
      "character": "Girl",
      "text": "阿澈，再画下去，咖啡都凉了。",
      "tagged": "[Girl]{Voice:teasing}阿澈，再画下去，咖啡都凉了。",
      "start": 2.6,
      "end": 6.056,
      "sourceSha256": "50de074f5df6ce40315979c129df1ca7699320079977f41703b70016abde799a"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "character": "Boy",
      "text": "先别动。你的影子正好到这里。",
      "tagged": "[Boy]{Voice:gentle}先别动。你的影子正好到这里。",
      "start": 6.6,
      "end": 9.264,
      "sourceSha256": "1a444f2d3b798d15eb1c72ffd133541187f708865fe2e3548457fe874a582f6d"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "character": "Girl",
      "text": "我的影子都坐累了。",
      "tagged": "[Girl]{Voice:teasing}我的影子都坐累了。",
      "start": 9.7,
      "end": 11.572,
      "sourceSha256": "ec8748bcfe9276ff054e344ff860bcdd3ef0f75bae954052a7bc2fbead36495d"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "character": "Girl",
      "text": "接一句？",
      "tagged": "[Girl]{Voice:bright}接一句？",
      "start": 14.4,
      "end": 15.456,
      "sourceSha256": "45904823fce7e19d4951a8dc406a9379f406b7a1e997d7387d62d25a943154dc"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "character": "Boy",
      "text": "唱还行，跳不会。",
      "tagged": "[Boy]{Voice:gentle}唱还行，跳不会。",
      "start": 15.85,
      "end": 17.722,
      "sourceSha256": "188147853b5635e6c5f6c56a7206fe4b7e63764b51a4684e6ee80cf61363e7b5"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "character": "Girl",
      "text": "不是说不会跳？",
      "tagged": "[Girl]{Voice:teasing}不是说不会跳？",
      "start": 95.3,
      "end": 96.932,
      "sourceSha256": "6f9141e6e527766e2ba9d5dbcf64b00848f2c7d02a98f0a4e40fb122b149b5c3"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "character": "Boy",
      "text": "我只跟了你半步。",
      "tagged": "[Boy]{Voice:gentle}我只跟了你半步。",
      "start": 97.35000000000001,
      "end": 98.98200000000001,
      "sourceSha256": "c09461e245546b3dd6b0e76c1605e8559dfab87fbff258a272cd130bfa15bc43"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "character": "Girl",
      "text": "咖啡真的凉了。",
      "tagged": "[Girl]{Voice:amused}咖啡真的凉了。",
      "start": 99.5,
      "end": 101.132,
      "sourceSha256": "b7da68648ba877ca04c71cf3afefffc7f284272c361c40433006184873afdce4"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "character": "Boy",
      "text": "正好，现在能喝了。",
      "tagged": "[Boy]{Voice:gentle}正好，现在能喝了。",
      "start": 101.60000000000001,
      "end": 103.23200000000001,
      "sourceSha256": "db20230225ece14cc8d85331b0ff75ab2b6da092b8ef9c2b5f7bab59235fd858"
    }
  ],
  "lyrics": [
    {
      "start": 21.18,
      "end": 24.700000000000003,
      "text": "叮一声，杯沿碰到晴天",
      "character": "Girl",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.66,
      "end": 28.96,
      "text": "你抬头，刚好接上这一拍",
      "character": "Girl",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.86,
      "end": 33.7,
      "text": "窗边的光，偷偷走过来",
      "character": "Girl",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.94,
      "end": 38.32,
      "text": "把你的影子，也拉起来",
      "character": "Girl",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 38.480000000000004,
      "end": 42.82,
      "text": "笔尖停在，你笑起来之前",
      "character": "Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.46,
      "end": 47.66,
      "text": "这一页，怎么也画不完",
      "character": "Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.61,
      "end": 52.14,
      "text": "如果今天，只记住一段",
      "character": "Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.24,
      "end": 56.800000000000004,
      "text": "就记住，你等我的半拍",
      "character": "Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.82,
      "end": 61.44,
      "text": "往左半步，借一点光",
      "character": "Girl+Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 61.400000000000006,
      "end": 66.16,
      "text": "往右半步，心事先放一旁",
      "character": "Girl+Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.26,
      "end": 70.4,
      "text": "慢半拍，也没关系",
      "character": "Girl+Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 70.44,
      "end": 75.32000000000001,
      "text": "我等你，把这一句唱完",
      "character": "Girl+Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.30000000000001,
      "end": 81.06,
      "text": "叮一声，落在午后窗前",
      "character": "Girl+Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    },
    {
      "start": 81.0,
      "end": 84.52,
      "text": "这一拍，我们都在里面",
      "character": "Girl+Boy",
      "kind": "song"
    }
  ],
